    <formulas>
        <description>Is used to build the feed item post. This entry contains the file renamed rext for ONE file.
Do HTMLENCODE to have it properly published as a feed item record on case. It escapes sensitive characters.

Wrapping post in &lt;p&gt; to have each sentence on separate rows in Feed Item post.  (feed item do not support &lt;br&gt;).</description>
